// The shadow stack of debug builds: each function pushes a frame (function,
// file, line) onto the chain, so that a panic can print where it happened.
// Generated code reads and writes the chain's top through this variable.

/** The innermost frame of this OS thread, or null; a task carries its own while it is parked. */
//ore:threadlocal
//ore:export ore_rt_top
let top: ptr
